---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'About Us — HarmonyBreath';
const description = 'HarmonyBreath is a free, privacy-first breathwork platform. Learn about our mission to make breathing techniques accessible to everyone.';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://harmonybreath.com/about/';
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1 hero-gradient-mesh relative">
    <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="text-center space-y-4 mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono">
          Our Mission
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white">About HarmonyBreath</h1>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base font-sans font-light">
          Making breathwork accessible, private, and free for everyone.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light [&_h2]:text-white [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:sm:text-2xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-4 [&_strong]:text-white [&_strong]:font-medium [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:list-inside [&_ul]:space-y-2 [&_ul]:text-neutral-400">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>
          HarmonyBreath was created with a simple vision: to provide a high-quality, well-crafted breathwork tool that respects your privacy. In a digital landscape where user data is often treated as a commodity, we set out to prove that a wellness platform can be both effective and completely private.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe that conscious breathing is one of the most powerful tools available for improving mental and physical health. Yet most breathwork apps require accounts, collect data, or charge subscription fees. HarmonyBreath exists to remove those barriers.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <p>
          HarmonyBreath is a curated platform featuring several well-known breathing techniques, each with dedicated guided timers and educational content:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong><a href="/wim-hof/" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">Wim Hof Method</a></strong> — Energizing rhythmic breathing with breath retention holds.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/box-breathing/" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">Box Breathing (4-4-4-4)</a></strong> — Equal-cadence breathing for staying calm and composed.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/4-7-8-breathing/" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">4-7-8 Relaxing Breath</a></strong> — Extended exhalation technique for relaxation and winding down.</li>
          <li><strong>Diaphragmatic / Belly Breathing</strong> — Deep abdominal breathing for grounding and relaxation.</li>
          <li><strong>Nadi Shodhana</strong> — Alternate nostril pranayama for balance and mental focus.</li>
          <li><strong>Tummo Inner Fire</strong> — Traditional Himalayan breathing for inner warmth and vitality.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Our Principles</h2>
        <p><strong>Privacy by Design.</strong> Your practice stays on your device. No accounts, no tracking, no data collection. HarmonyBreath operates with a strict zero-data policy.</p>
        <p><strong>Technique-Faithful.</strong> Every technique on our platform follows its traditional, established pattern, so our guided sessions keep to the rhythm each practice is known for.</p>
        <p><strong>100% Free.</strong> No subscriptions, no paywalls, no premium tiers. All techniques and features are available to everyone without charge, forever.</p>
        <p><strong>Open & Transparent.</strong> We believe in openness. Our approach is straightforward: build tools that help people breathe better, without hidden agendas.</p>

        <h2>Our Team</h2>
        <p>
          HarmonyBreath is built by a small, independent team passionate about breathwork, meditation technology, and digital privacy. We are practitioners ourselves — we use HarmonyBreath daily and are committed to continuous improvement based on real user feedback.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
